# Getting Started with Agent Eval Framework

This guide will walk you through setting up the **LLM Agent Evaluation & Guardrail Pipeline** on your local machine using the files exported from Google Colab.

---

## 1. Export Files from Google Colab

Before running the test suite locally on your desktop, ensure you have downloaded the two core source files from your Google Colab environment:

1. Open your Google Colab notebook (`llm_agent_eval.ipynb`).
2. Locate the generated files in the Colab file explorer on the left sidebar:
   - `src/agent.py`
   - `tests/test_evals.py`
3. Right-click each file and select **Download** to save them to your local desktop computer.

---

